87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mizuka, a very lax character shown quickly to have various traits such as having the largest breast size and also being the oldest of the crew. Despite the age difference between Naoto to be only a few months, Mizuka refers herself as \"Naoto’s older sister\", and acts this way as well. Contrary to her personality of being laidback, Mizuka is extremely intelligent–receiving top grades in her classes. However, her weakness is that her ridiculously low physical endurance limits her to walking to school. Her intelligence, however, corresponds to her sharpness in detecting changes to the people around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Visual Novels and Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16645"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"杏鈴の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"直人と杏鈴の３人で仲良くすごす事が心地良い模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はなまけものでいつも気だるそうにしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹、杏鈴のおっぱいと猫が好き。記憶力に優れる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2367","sourceWorkId":"19026","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"杏鈴的姐姐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对与直人、杏鈴的3人友好关系觉得很舒服的样子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格懒惰，总是显得很不耐烦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢妹妹杏鈴的胸部与猫。记忆力很好。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「不管怎么说，这个世界上不可思议的事情是很多的呀」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22637"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2367","sourceWorkId":"19026","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"h","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2367","sourceWorkId":"19026","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2367","sourceWorkId":"19026","so